Significant modifications made in this repository
-------------------------------------------------

1. Rebranded the user-visible product to "dsalpha", and replaced the original
   logo, wordmark and favicon artwork with marks of our own. No trademark or
   brand asset of the original project is redistributed here.

2. Added knowledge-base tools (src/tools/knowledge_base/) that read and write a
   shared markdown vault.

3. Added a WeChat channel (src/gateway/ilink/, src/gateway/wechat/): a Python
   port of the iLink bot client plus a per-user channel that runs agent turns
   through the app's own HTTP API.

4. Reordered the system prompt so the cacheable prefix comes first, and taught
   the token counter DeepSeek's cache-hit spellings.

5. Tightened resource limits for containers and the PTC sandbox, and made the
   sandbox provider configurable per deployment.

6. Added a build-time switch to present only the sign-in methods a deployment
   actually supports.
